  "description": "Unt Savari is a camel spring rider in Mango Yellow that brings a desert ride into the play park. The hump at the back pops up as the camel rocks, which makes the ride feel closer to sitting on a real camel. It is designed for ages 3 to 8. The rider is small, with a product area of 3'9\" x 1'6\" and a safe play area of 7'9\" x 5'6\". Two or three can sit in a row beside a toddler area. Riding it builds imagination and creativity in the youngest children. Like Kukura, it comes from our Organic Play collection. The roto-moulded body has our 3-year warranty, and the spring has a 1-year warranty. Ask us for a drawing with riders placed on your site.",
